Movie Recommendation System
A content-based movie recommendation system built with Python, FastAPI, Pandas, Scikit-learn, and TF-IDF.
The system recommends movies that are similar to a movie provided by the user. It analyzes movie information such as genres, keywords, tagline, cast, and director, converts these features into numerical vectors using TF-IDF, and calculates similarity between movies using cosine similarity.
The recommendation engine is exposed through a REST API using FastAPI.
Features
🎬 Content-based movie recommendations
🔎 Approximate movie-title matching using difflib
🧠 TF-IDF based feature extraction
📊 Cosine similarity for finding similar movies
⚡ FastAPI REST API
🌐 CORS enabled for frontend integration
🐼 Pandas-based data preprocessing
📦 JSON API responses
🔄 Returns up to 29 similar movies for a selected movie

🛠️ Technologies Used
Technology || Purpose
Python - Core programming language
FastAPI	- REST API framework
Pandas	- Dataset loading and preprocessing
Scikit-learn	- TF-IDF and cosine similarity
Pydantic -	API request validation
difflib	- Fuzzy movie-title matching
Uvicorn	- ASGI server
How the Recommendation System Works

This project uses a content-based filtering approach.

Instead of recommending movies based on what other users watched, the system compares the characteristics of movies.
Recommendation Pipeline
                 Movie Dataset
                       │
                       ▼
              Data Preprocessing
                       │
                       ▼
       ┌──────────────────────────────┐
       │ Selected Movie Features      │
       │                              │
       │ • Genres                     │
       │ • Keywords                   │
       │ • Tagline                    │
       │ • Cast                       │
       │ • Director                   │
       └──────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
             Combine All Features
                       │
                       ▼
             TF-IDF Vectorization
                       │
                       ▼
             Feature Vectors
                       │
                       ▼
            Cosine Similarity
                       │
                       ▼
              Similarity Ranking
                       │
                       ▼
          Top Movie Recommendations
Dataset

The application expects a CSV file named:
(movies.csv)
The dataset should contain columns similar to:
index
title
genres
keywords
tagline
cast
director

